ENDRACOMMANDER NX - RUN 002
First calculator test build

Transfer EndraCommanderNX_Run002.tns
to a folder on your TI-Nspire.
Open it with Ndless already active.

FIRST CHECK:
1. Both panes appear.
2. Arrows select files/folders.
3. TAB switches panes.
4. MENU opens all actions.
5. ESC exits to the TI browser.

Use the included test files before
working on important documents.
Set one pane to your Left sample
folder and the other to empty Right.

MAIN CONTROLS
ENTER: open / view / launch
LEFT: parent folder
SPACE: mark; A: mark all
C: copy to other pane
M: move to other pane
R: rename; N: new folder
DEL: delete files or empty folders
V: text; H: hex; Z: ZIP contents
P: create ZIP; X: extract ZIP
F: folders only; S: filter names
T: sort by name / size / date
W: save workspace; B: go there
G: type path; D: Documents
Y: theme; I: device information

ZIP actions use the highlighted item.
Copy/move/delete use marked items,
or the highlighted item if none marked.
Existing destinations are refused.

This is a genuine compiled Ndless app.
Hardware behavior is not yet tested.
The nSonic native OS hook is OFF.
Saved workspace is an in-app shortcut.
No CPU overclock or resident hook.

This guide is plain text for nTxt or
EndraCommander NX's text viewer.
